# 22050_mono/ — derived 22 050 Hz mono 16-bit PCM WAVs, generated by
# convert.py from the originals in this directory. They're now
# committed (~11 MB) so the e2e tests are self-contained in CI without
# pulling python3-{soundfile,scipy} into the runner. convert.py is
# still idempotent, so re-running locally is a no-op on cache hit.
